-the structure space is the branch projection of a cylinder tree in `(ℕ → Bool) × (ℕ → ℕ)`,
-through the query-code closed embedding —
-
-`c ∈ B ↔ ∃ g : ℕ → ℕ, ∀ n, (prefix (queryCode c) n, prefix g n) ∈ T n`.
