-## Main Results
-
-- `modelsOf_isClopenable`: `ModelsOf φ` is clopenable (admits a finer Polish
-  topology making it clopen).
-- `modelsOf_standardBorel`: The subtype `↥(ModelsOf φ)` is standard Borel.
